{"Id":"CHECK_0193","Area":"Audit policy","AuditCheck":"'Audit Other Object Access Events' is set to 'Success and Failure'","Expected":"AuditEquals: 3","Steps":"On {HOST}, run the following command in an elevated Command Prompt:\n\nauditpol /get /subcategory:\"{0cce9227-69ae-11d9-bed3-505054503030}\"\n\nCheck the Setting returned for 'Other Object Access Events'. Expected result: Success and Failure.","CheckType":"Command (auditpol)","Rationale":"Cyberfort recommends auditing other object access events to help detect suspicious activity and preserve evidence for incident investigation.","Impact":"Additional audit events increase Security log volume and may require more storage, retention and collection capacity."},
