{"Id":"CHECK_0195","Area":"Audit policy","AuditCheck":"'Audit Audit Policy Change' is set to include 'Success'","Expected":"AuditIncludes: 1","Steps":"On {HOST}, run the following command in an elevated Command Prompt:\n\nauditpol /get /subcategory:\"{0cce922f-69ae-11d9-bed3-505054503030}\"\n\nCheck the Setting returned for 'Audit Policy Change'. Expected result: Success or Success and Failure.","CheckType":"Command (auditpol)","Rationale":"If no audit settings are configured, or if audit settings are too lax on the computers in your organization, security incidents might not be detected, or not enough evidence will be available for network forensic analysis after security incidents occur.","Impact":"Advanced audit logging will generate additional events when this feature is enabled."},
{"Id":"CHECK_0196","Area":"Audit policy","AuditCheck":"'Audit Authentication Policy Change' is set to include 'Success'","Expected":"AuditIncludes: 1","Steps":"On {HOST}, run the following command in an elevated Command Prompt:\n\nauditpol /get /subcategory:\"{0cce9230-69ae-11d9-bed3-505054503030}\"\n\nCheck the Setting returned for 'Authentication Policy Change'. Expected result: Success or Success and Failure.","CheckType":"Command (auditpol)","Rationale":"If no audit settings are configured, or if audit settings are too lax on the computers in your organization, security incidents might not be detected, or not enough evidence will be available for network forensic analysis after security incidents occur.","Impact":"Advanced audit logging will generate additional events when this feature is enabled."},
{"Id":"CHECK_0197","Area":"Audit policy","AuditCheck":"'Audit Authorization Policy Change' is set to include 'Success'","Expected":"AuditIncludes: 1","Steps":"On {HOST}, run the following command in an elevated Command Prompt:\n\nauditpol /get /subcategory:\"{0cce9231-69ae-11d9-bed3-505054503030}\"\n\nCheck the Setting returned for 'Authorization Policy Change'. Expected result: Success or Success and Failure.","CheckType":"Command (auditpol)","Rationale":"Cyberfort recommends auditing authorization policy change to help detect suspicious activity and preserve evidence for incident investigation.","Impact":"Additional audit events increase Security log volume and may require more storage, retention and collection capacity."},
{"Id":"CHECK_0198","Area":"Audit policy","AuditCheck":"'Audit MPSSVC Rule-Level Policy Change' is set to 'Success and Failure'","Expected":"AuditEquals: 3","Steps":"On {HOST}, run the following command in an elevated Command Prompt:\n\nauditpol /get /subcategory:\"{0cce9232-69ae-11d9-bed3-505054503030}\"\n\nCheck the Setting returned for 'MPSSVC Rule-Level Policy Change'. Expected result: Success and Failure.","CheckType":"Command (auditpol)","Rationale":"Cyberfort recommends auditing Windows Firewall rule and policy changes to help detect suspicious activity and preserve evidence for incident investigation.","Impact":"Additional audit events increase Security log volume and may require more storage, retention and collection capacity."},
{"Id":"CHECK_0199","Area":"Audit policy","AuditCheck":"'Audit Other Policy Change Events' is set to include 'Failure'","Expected":"AuditIncludes: 2","Steps":"On {HOST}, run the following command in an elevated Command Prompt:\n\nauditpol /get /subcategory:\"{0cce9234-69ae-11d9-bed3-505054503030}\"\n\nCheck the Setting returned for 'Other Policy Change Events'. Expected result: Failure or Success and Failure.","CheckType":"Command (auditpol)","Rationale":"Cyberfort recommends auditing other policy change events to help detect suspicious activity and preserve evidence for incident investigation.","Impact":"Additional audit events increase Security log volume and may require more storage, retention and collection capacity."},
