{"Id":"CHECK_0201","Area":"Audit policy","AuditCheck":"'Audit IPsec Driver' is set to 'Success and Failure'","Expected":"AuditEquals: 3","Steps":"On {HOST}, run the following command in an elevated Command Prompt:\n\nauditpol /get /subcategory:\"{0cce9213-69ae-11d9-bed3-505054503030}\"\n\nCheck the Setting returned for 'IPsec Driver'. Expected result: Success and Failure.","CheckType":"Command (auditpol)","Rationale":"Cyberfort recommends auditing IPsec driver activity to help detect suspicious activity and preserve evidence for incident investigation.","Impact":"Additional audit events increase Security log volume and may require more storage, retention and collection capacity."},
{"Id":"CHECK_0202","Area":"Audit policy","AuditCheck":"'Audit Other System Events' is set to 'Success and Failure'","Expected":"AuditEquals: 3","Steps":"On {HOST}, run the following command in an elevated Command Prompt:\n\nauditpol /get /subcategory:\"{0cce9214-69ae-11d9-bed3-505054503030}\"\n\nCheck the Setting returned for 'Other System Events'. Expected result: Success and Failure.","CheckType":"Command (auditpol)","Rationale":"Capturing these audit events may be useful for identifying when the Windows Firewall is not performing as expected.","Impact":"Advanced audit logging will generate additional events when this feature is enabled."},
{"Id":"CHECK_0203","Area":"Audit policy","AuditCheck":"'Audit Security State Change' is set to include 'Success'","Expected":"AuditIncludes: 1","Steps":"On {HOST}, run the following command in an elevated Command Prompt:\n\nauditpol /get /subcategory:\"{0cce9210-69ae-11d9-bed3-505054503030}\"\n\nCheck the Setting returned for 'Security State Change'. Expected result: Success or Success and Failure.","CheckType":"Command (auditpol)","Rationale":"If no audit settings are configured, or if audit settings are too lax on the computers in your organization, security incidents might not be detected, or not enough evidence will be available for network forensic analysis after security incidents occur.","Impact":"Advanced audit logging will generate additional events when this feature is enabled."},
