and data without changing them. A missing value remains unresolved unless the check explicitly requires absence."},"CheckType":"GUI and registry verification","Rationale":"This Microsoft feature is designed to collect data and suggest apps based on that data collected.","Impact":"The suggested apps in Windows Ink Workspace will not be allowed."},
{"Id":"CHECK_0495","Area":"Administrative templates","AuditCheck":"'Allow Windows Ink Workspace' is set to 'Enabled: On, but disallow access above lock' OR 'Enabled: Disabled'","Expected":"One of: 0 | 1","Steps":{"Workgroup":"On {HOST}, open Local Group Policy Editor (gpedit.msc). Navigate to:\n\nComputer Configuration\\Administrative Templates\\Windows Components\\Windows Ink Workspace\\Allow Windows Ink Workspace\n\nCheck that 'Allow Windows Ink Workspace' is set to Enabled: On, but disallow access above lock' OR 'Enabled: Disabled.\n\nGP UI path:\nComputer Configuration\\Policies\\Administrative Templates\\Windows Components\\Windows Ink Workspace\\Allow Windows Ink Workspace\n\nRead the displayed setting.\n\nRegistry verification on {HOST}:\nOpen Registry Editor (regedit.exe) and read the following existing values in the 64-bit registry view:\n\nKey: HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\WindowsInkWorkspace\nValue name: AllowWindowsInkWorkspace\nExpected type: REG_DWORD\nExpected data: one of 0 (decimal; 0x00000000), 1 (decimal; 0x00000001)\n\nRead the type and data without changing them. A missing value remains unresolved unless the check explicitly requires absence.","Shared":"Open Group Policy Management (gpmc.msc) on an administrative computer. Right-click Group Policy Results and start Group Policy Results Wizard. Select {HOST} as the target computer, complete the wizard, and open the Settings tab. Inspect the applied setting at:\n\nComputer Configuration\\Policies\\Administrative Templates\\Windows Components\\Windows Ink Workspace\\Allow Windows Ink Workspace\n\nCheck that 'Allow Windows Ink Workspace' is set to Enabled: On, but disallow access above lock' OR 'Enabled: Disabled.\n\nRegistry verification on {HOST}:\nOpen Registry Editor (regedit.exe) and read the following existing values in the 64-bit registry view:\n\nKey: HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\WindowsInkWorkspace\nValue name: AllowWindowsInkWorkspace\nExpected type: REG_DWORD\nExpected data: one of 0 (decimal; 0x00000000), 1 (decimal; 0x00000001)\n\nRead the type and data without changing them. A missing value remains unresolved unless the check explicitly requires absence."},"CheckType":"GUI and registry verification","Rationale":"Allowing any apps to be accessed while system is locked is not recommended.","Impact":"Windows Ink Workspace will not be permitted above the lock screen."},
